<title>UK: Sumitomo Realty sets 10 bln yen bond.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Realty sets 10 bln yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUMITOMO REALTY &amp; DEVELOPMENT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     2.575     MATURITY    30.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.775   PAY DATE  S 30.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (M) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
